@Essen thank you for working on the 0.5x0.5 design! 

My first change request is to rotate the whole PCB 180 degrees, so that the pin1 indicator would be in bottom left corner. 🙏  

I think @RebelMike has already changed the other designs as well to match this. https://discord.com/channels/1361349522684510449/1408134567491145728/1552431619565031635

@Lauri re: [60pin connector](https://github.com/wafer-space/chip-on-board-wire-bonded-pcbs/issues/11#issuecomment-5835840431). 

Last time I looked the 60pin was **significantly cheaper**
This cost must be balanced against different testing boards and would not allow p5p5 cob to be used on the standard motherboards. 

@Tim 'mithro' Ansell @stuart you guys want to chime in here on an opinion?
